s we unfortunately have  perfected this and I hope that we don't  have to do this again in the next 10  years or ever  the ATF and FBI are both on site here  helping local law enforcement with their  investigation and investigators say  terrorism was unlikely though they have  not completely ruled it out the gun that  was purchased by Mosley and used in this  shooting was purchased legally the  wounded victims are recovering at a  hospital and Anthony they are said they  are expected to survive  olenka thanks mola
 

